---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<PageLayout title="Uses" description="List of tools and apps I use.">
  <header class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold text-black dark:text-white">Uses</h1>
    <p class="text-sm">Updated Oct 31, 2026.</p>
  </header>

  <article class="post">
    <h3>Editor and terminal</h3>
    <ul class="list-none! pl-0!">
      <li>
        <a href="https://cursor.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Cursor</a
        > - Here are my{' '}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/rbika/dotfiles-macos/tree/main/src/cursor"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          settings and keybindings
        </a>
        .
        <ul>
          <li>
            Themes -{' '}
            <a
              href="https://github.com/rbika/helios-theme-vscode"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Helios theme
            </a>{' '}/
            <a
              href="https://github.com/rbika/dotfiles-macos/blob/main/src/cursor/settings.json"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              custom darker version
            </a>{' '}
            of the <a
              href="https://www.nordtheme.com/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Nord theme</a
            >.<br />
          </li>
          <li>
            Font -{' '}
            <a
              href="https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/mono/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              JetBrains Mono
            </a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://ghostty.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Ghostty</a
        > - Here is my{' '}
        <a
          href="https://github.com/rbika/dotfiles-macos/blob/main/src/zsh/.zshrc"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          zsh config
        </a>.
        <ul>
          <li>
            Theme -{' '}
            <a
              href="https://github.com/rbika/iterm2-nord-dark"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              custom darker version
            </a>{' '}
            of the <a
              href="https://www.nordtheme.com/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Nord theme</a
            >.<br />
          </li>
          <li>
            Font -{' '}
            <a
              href="https://www.jetbrains.com/lp/mono/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              JetBrains Mono
            </a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <h3>Developer tools</h3>
      <ul class="list-none! pl-0!">
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://brave.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Brave</a
          >{' '}
          - Preferred browsers.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://git-fork.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Fork</a
          > - Git client for macOS.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.postman.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Postman</a
          > - API client.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.figma.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Figma</a
          > - For simple edits.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Productivity</h3>
      <ul class="list-none! pl-0!">
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.raycast.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Raycast</a
          > - Spotlight replacement.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://alt-tab.app/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">AltTab</a
          > - Cmd+Tab replacement.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.craft.do/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Craft</a
          > - Multi-platform note-taking app with markdown support.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://karabiner-elements.pqrs.org/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            Karabiner Elements
          </a>{' '}
          - Keyboard customizer for macOS.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.apple.com/apple-music/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Spotify</a
          > - here are the playlists I've created to help me focus:
          <ul>
            <li>
              <a
                href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/3u6aUCIH6npA3zOXHeQJOC?si=dadd481f53804d94"
              >
                Lo-fi
              </a>,{' '}
              <a
                href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/4cRPEIeaz94yVZYwboI6GF?si=980541762b3149f3"
              >
                Piano
              </a>,{' '}
              <a
                href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/5QezRTqZie4X8stoTIxL2M?si=b9e2c7e5438c4af4"
              >
                Soundtracks
              </a>,{' '}
              <a
                href="https://open.spotify.com/playlist/6IqMZm2bJk6DjPxev7Qiyo?si=ce7da77d71fb4a9a"
              >
                Synthwave
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://www.drawio.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Draw.io</a
          > - Diagrams application.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://keepingyouawake.app/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">KeepingYouAwake</a
          > - Prevents your Mac from going to sleep.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://chatgpt.com/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">ChatGPT</a
          > - Daily assistant.
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/rbika/focus-time"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Focus Time</a
          > - Timer, Stopwatch and Pomodoro app.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </ul>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
